Search Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI
    participant Server
    participant FTS5
    participant Database

    CLI->>Server: GET /threads/search?q=query
    Server->>FTS5: SELECT FROM threads_fts WHERE threads_fts MATCH query
    Note over FTS5: BM25 ranking algorithm

    FTS5-->>Server: Thread IDs with scores
    Server->>Database: SELECT threads WHERE id IN (...)
    Database-->>Server: Thread data

    Server->>Server: Filter by visibility
    Server->>Server: Apply pagination
    Server-->>CLI: SearchResponse (hits with scores)